description:
Fixes missing TypeScript 3.1 typings in the npm package for moment. Fixes #5486.

Since 2.25.0, package.json specifies:

```json
    "typesVersions": {
        ">=3.1": {
            "*": [
                "ts3.1-typings/*"
            ]
        }
    },
```

but the `ts3.1-typings` folder was not included in the npm package.

